-- src:1374 | (a) in the case of a self-employed person who has, under subsection 152.05(1.1) of the Act, elected to receive benefits for the maximum number of weeks referred to in subparagraph 152.14(1)(b)(i) of the Act, the maximum number of weeks referred to in subparagraph 152.14(2)(b)(i) of the Act when the weeks of benefits are divided, less the number of weeks of provincial benefits that are paid to the provincial applicant, taking into account any weeks of provincial benefits that are paid at the accelerated rate referred to in subsection 76.4(3), if applicable; and
-- src:1375 | (b) in the case of a self-employed person who has, under subsection 152.05(1.1) of the Act, elected to receive benefits for the maximum number of weeks referred to in subparagraph 152.14(1)(b)(ii) of the Act, the number of weeks, rounded down to the nearest whole number, determined by the following formula:
